{\b\fs24 MrWallpaper}\par
{\i License Agreement and Important Information}\par
\par
Please read the following information carefully before installing MrWallpaper. By continuing with the installation, you agree to the terms of the license below.\par
\par
{\b 1. Installation}\par
MrWallpaper is installed for the current user only, in %LocalAppData%\\Programs\\MrWallpaper. Administrator privileges are not required.\par
\par
{\b 2. System Behavior}\par
MrWallpaper runs only while its window is open. It does not install background services or processes, system tray icons, or startup entries.\par
\par
{\b 3. Wallpaper Content}\par
Wallpapers are provided by wallhaven.cc. All artwork remains the property of its respective creators. Please respect the rights of the artists when using or sharing their work.\par
\par
{\b 4. Your Downloads}\par
Downloaded wallpapers are saved to Pictures\\MrWallpaper. These files are not removed if you uninstall the application.\par
